    "en": "Worked example"
   },
   "problem": {
    "en": "A sine wave on a CRO is 6 divisions peak to peak and one cycle spans 4 divisions. The settings are 2 V/div and 5 ms/div. Find V_pp, V_m, V_rms and the frequency."
   },
   "steps": [
    {
     "en": "V_pp = 6 × 2 = 12 V, so V_m = 6 V."
    },
    {
     "en": "V_rms = V_m/√2 = 6/1.414 ≈ 4.24 V."
    },
    {
     "en": "T = 4 × 5 ms = 20 ms, so f = 1/0.020 = 50 Hz."
    }
   ],
   "answer": {
    "en": "V_pp = 12 V, V_m = 6 V, V_rms ≈ 4.24 V, f = 50 Hz"
   },
